List the plugins installed in this project and globally

Usage: rover plugin list [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -g, --global
          List only the global install root, shared by every project, even inside a project that has its own
  -m, --manifest-path <FILE>
          List the project whose manifest this is, rather than the one found by searching up from the working directory
